title: Reject unrepresentable erasure-coding branch indices
doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      polkadot-erasure-coding's branch_hash now returns BranchOutOfBounds for
      indices exceeding u32::MAX instead of truncating them to an existing
      chunk index on wider platforms. Valid u32 indices retain their behavior.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-erasure-coding
    bump: patch
